{"version":1,"content":"<p>金鐘61戲劇類頒獎典禮焦點獎項之一「迷你劇集（電視電影）女主角獎」，賽前大家的焦點都放在《回魂計》兩位女主角舒淇、李心潔之爭，結果兩人都雙雙落敗，由《親密之海》的瑞瑪席丹贏得獎項。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;瑞瑪席丹領獎時難</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:12:12.886751+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T13:34:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:20.527276+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:20.527276+00:00","content_hash":"605c8384c482fa257efec2a88566a0f1825b62c4ff8f0d62f7aa5e7b5b6dfc15","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}